 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you doing? Poor guy. Stair lifts are great, they fit in small space. Is it something he can use himself? Then maybe a chair for the day, so he can explore. A friend can use the chair lift up once, and it' his turn to help. Yes, but make sure it' light and doesn't block the door. Some have wheels that fold away. Keep things as easy for him as possible. A chair by the kitchen and bathroom, and a cup of tea waiting in the living room.",
